6. THE OPTIONS, with numbers (all inside the case ruling of 7 September 2026: the Peli 1450 never changes)

6a. Operating modes at night: PS-NIGHT-RELAY, the lowest state that still meets M1's must-hold (a handheld's
    message over the LoRa mesh reaches a remote correspondent over Iridium, or APRS; the kit keeps running).
  load ON in PS-NIGHT-RELAY              at load W  battery W  kind
  -------------------------------------  ---------  ---------  ----
